The Lord of the Rings: The Return of the King is a adventure,
fantasy, action film directed by Peter Jackson.

3
00:24:07,199 --> 00:24:13,199
As armies mass for a final battle that will decide the fate of the world--and powerful, ancient forces of Light and Dark compete to
determine the outcome--one member of the Fellowship of the Ring is revealed as the noble heir to the throne of the Kings of Men.

4
00:32:09,599 --> 00:32:15,599
Yet, the sole hope for triumph over evil lies with a brave hobbit, Frodo, who, accompanied by his loyal friend Sam and the hideous, wretched
Gollum, ventures deep into the very dark heart of Mordor on his seemingly impossible quest to destroy the Ring of Power.​

5
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:18,000
Frodo, played by Elijah Wood.

6
00:48:14,399 --> 00:48:20,399
Gandalf, played by Ian McKellen.

7
